id: pm-gantt-chart-install-routes-1022
title: Replace non-installable README source shorthand with registry activation
description: Registry audit found owner/repository shorthand resolves as a missing local path. Document pinned npm project activation with npx and bunx and guard the README command. Keep the separate SDK prose alignment task out of this fix.
