comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T23:26:04.441Z",codex-agent,Replace only the consumer source route; preserve dependency pins and separate SDK documentation task. Verify in fresh plain trackers using both runners and prove the documentation regression fails with the original README.
  "2026-10-21T23:26:53.699Z",codex-agent,"Targeted documentation suite: 5 passed, 0 failed. Typecheck and lint passed. Revert proof: restoring only the original README makes the new README regression exit 1; restoring the corrected README passes. Fresh npx and bunx registry acceptance is being recorded separately."
  "2026-10-21T23:29:14.334Z",codex-agent,"Fresh plain-directory README verification with CLI 2026.10.21: npx init exit 0; npx registry install exit 0; bunx init exit 0; bunx registry install exit 0. Each runner used its own empty project and home/config directories, with no Git repository. An initial prefer-offline metadata lookup returned ETARGET; online metadata refresh made the identical pinned route pass."
  "2026-10-21T23:33:05.211Z",codex-agent,"Full npm gate has passed 255/255 tests with zero skipped and 100% measured lines, branches and functions at unchanged thresholds; packed acceptance passed npm-current, bun-current and npm-minimum. Remaining verification steps and the full Bun gate are pending. Focused docs and PM-linked tests passed 5/5; README-only revert failed as required."
  "2026-10-21T23:36:45.827Z",codex-agent,"Final local validation: npm run release:check exit 0 and bun run release:check exit 0, each 255 passed / 0 failed / 0 skipped at unchanged 100% coverage thresholds. Each gate passed all three packed consumer scenarios. README npx and bunx init/install commands all exit 0 in fresh plain trackers; original README revert fails. Ready for PR CI verification; item remains in_progress and will be released for orchestrator review."
